{
  "about": "The Lab's loader mapper (Original Game > Config loaders): the functions zoo.exe reads a config key with - each call's pushes, nearest first: 'key' is the key's text, 'dest' where the value goes - and the structs known loaders fill (the rest are asked when saved). A name for a loader of globals only (AnimalSettings) names the loader (loadAnimalSettings), not a struct.",
